    "detailed_description": "As a celestial being, it is your task to travel across dimensions and deconstruct the old ones. In this cozy and relaxing game, you'll recycle objects from fractured worlds to create a tranquil haven of your own.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054930/extras/a4352ec85c55918d809fa4bef427071f.poster.avif?t=1721746425\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054930/extras/a4352ec85c55918d809fa4bef427071f.webp?t=1721746425\" class=\"bb_img\" width=607 height=455 /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \ud83d\udce6<strong>Explore and Gather</strong>: Venture into shattered dimensions, collect unique resources by dismantling objects.<br></li><li> \ud83d\ude80<strong>Upgrade and Expand</strong>: Enhance your tools and boost your recycling prowess to take on bigger challenges.<br></li><li> \ud83c\udf34<strong>Create Your Oasis</strong>: Build your own dimension by utilizing the power of building, crafting and farming<br></li><li> \ud83d\udc4b<strong>Lend a Hand</strong>: Assist the inhabitants of other dimensions, spreading peace and harmony across the cosmos</li></ul><br>Rediscover the beauty in broken worlds and craft a sanctuary of serenity. The adventure awaits!",
